      : pk ? sprintf(#seq_ui_lbl, "Factory presets (%d): click for the list, by genre, feel and role; the arrows or the wheel step through them. A preset replaces the pattern on screen, aimed at the bank shown (one undo step).", seq_ui_pcount)
